        "official_en_sha256": "7074f1e12fef78834c48e9c2470b0ec1c90dfca68b39050e629143fef3fd612b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あの鎧の人たちと\r\n昔、会ったことがあるような気がするの。",
        "official_en": "...But, I have a feeling I’ve met those armored knights before...a long time ago.",
        "real_en": "I feel like I've met those people in armor before... a long time ago."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
