        "official_en_sha256": "37dbbb0b32ac97b19d5a6a9a9cb93e5cd2c756ab5c13fe9fd0685b8d14fd0ecd"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ここから歩いて行くには距離がある。\r\n一度コルの村に寄って\r\nチョコボを借りたほうがよさそうだ。",
        "official_en": "Indeed. It’s quite the distance to cover on foot. I suggest we stop by Kol and borrow some chocobos for the journey.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
