    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_022_01:022_01_020:fd4f8a96",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C01_022_01",
        "key": "022_01_020",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_022_01:022_01_020:fd4f8a96",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C01_022_01:022_01_020:fd4f8a96",
        "jp_sha256": "f0976e647ca8a660d57471cecd697c77b64dab96b3b2938b29476c4a50a10f87",
        "official_en_sha256": "bb90376202cf77ecdb68a53c8db33893ea821ef679eecf74ffc41837f41d6873"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "こんな状態なのに放っておけるかよ。\r\nそれに常闇との戦いのとき\r\nフィーナに助けてもらったのを忘れたのか？",
        "official_en": "What? We can’t just leave her. And remember, she was the one who saved <text style=\"italic\">us</>—not the other way around.",
        "real_en": "How can we just leave her like this? Besides, have you forgotten that Fina saved me when we fought Veritas of the Dark?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
